    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0179" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg77"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4 Air Armaments/234: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Acting Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-03-28T19:00:00-05:00">March 28, 1933—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>313. Your 584, March 22, 6 p.m., and 589, March 23, 8 p.m.<anchor n="11"
                        xml:id="d61-f1"/> We see no objection to the draft joint statement and
                    approve of your proposed method of handling the matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
